<h3>4.3 Git Branching Policy Enforced</h3>
<p>As documented in [<code>docs/branching-policy.md</code>](file:///d:/DevOps/docs/branching-policy.md):</p>
<ul><li><code>main</code>: Permanent production branch. Direct commits strictly prohibited.</li></ul>
<ul><li><code>develop</code>: Permanent integration branch. Features merge here via Pull Requests.</li></ul>
<ul><li><code>feature/*</code>: Temporary feature branches branched off <code>develop</code> and deleted post-merge.</li></ul>
