<td>2 to 4 hours (Manual rollbacks)</td>
<td><b>&lt; 6 seconds (Automated symlink rollback)</b></td>
</tr>
</table>
<h3>17.2 Conclusion</h3>
<p>The <b>Motor Insurance Claim Portal CI/CD Pipeline</b> successfully implements and demonstrates all 14 syllabus tasks required for a complete, production-grade DevOps lifecycle. By unifying version control, automated quality testing, pipeline-as-code, containerization, and configuration management, the system provides high availability, enterprise security, and rapid, zero-downtime recovery. The project stands as a complete, fully verified template for modern cloud-native software delivery.</p>

